<title>USA: FORECAST - Estimates for API data for Nov 8 week.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - Estimates for API data for Nov 8 week.</headline>
<text>
<p>(STOCKS IN THOUSAND/BBLS, CHANGES IN MLN/BBLS)</p>
<p>REUTER SURVEY ESTIMATES*	   STOCKS FOR</p>
<p>FOR WEEK ENDED 11/08/96	    WEEK ENDED 11/01/96-CHANGE</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>CRUDE.........UP 0.60 million bbls    312,422	  UP 9.296 MLN</p>
<p>DISTILLATE....UP 0.80 million bbls    117,462	  DN 0.429 MLN</p>
<p>GASOLINE......UP 1.00 million bbls    190,761	  UP 4.742 MLN</p>
<p>UTILIZATION...DN 0.20 pct pts     93.9 PCT	 DN 0.1 PCT PT</p>
<p>*NB - The survey estimate is derived by omitting the high and the low forecast and averaging the rest.</p>
</text>
